{{!
    Sent to an address captured before the account was removed. By the time this goes out
    there is no record left to look one up from.
}}
<h2>{{#IsHousehold}}Your household has been deleted{{/IsHousehold}}{{^IsHousehold}}Your account has been deleted{{/IsHousehold}}</h2>

<p>Hi {{UserName}},</p>

{{#IsHousehold}}
<p><strong>{{HouseholdName}}</strong> and everything in it has been permanently deleted, as requested on {{RequestedOn}}.</p>
{{/IsHousehold}}
{{^IsHousehold}}
<p>Your account has been permanently deleted, as requested on {{RequestedOn}}. You can no longer sign in.</p>
{{/IsHousehold}}

<p>This is the last email you will receive from us.</p>

<p>If you did not expect this, reply to this message — but be aware the data itself is gone and cannot be restored.</p>
